#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for design studios, creative agencies and freelancers. A large opening statement, a staggered project grid with a page for every project, a black services band, client logos, counting figures, a studio photo strip and a contact form that needs no plugin — six colour palettes, five type pairings, visitor dark mode and WooCommerce support. Full site editing throughout."
msgstr ""

